    <p class="post-lead"><strong>Short answer:</strong> on July 14, 2026, Telegram launched the <strong>Rich Text Editor</strong> — Premium subscribers only. It lets you write fully formatted posts up to <strong>32,768 characters</strong> with headings, tables, lists, code blocks, and formulas, and place photos or videos anywhere inside the text. To open it, type more than 3 lines and tap the ⛶ icon that appears. No Premium yet? Get it through <a href="https://telegram.me/starsjoybot" target="_blank" rel="noopener">@starsjoybot</a>, paid with an Uzcard or Humo card.</p>
